                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/5526: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Bell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-09-15T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                                1924—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>217. Your 343, September 13, 10 A.M. The Department approves your action in
                    circularizing consuls as indicated in last paragraph.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
